for a network install which of course assumes that it is possible to prepare 
boot floppies. I also assume that it should be possible to set up my Intel 
FreeBSD box to serve bootp requests and to provide the alpha installation 
files from the FreeBSD alpha distribution cd. Any comments on that? 

TIA 

Ulrich 

